  "status": "wip",
  "needs_ocr": false,
  "retry": true,
  "notes": [
    "The daily attendance book (first tab) is claimed at login by the attendance popups. The other tabs are campaign attendance books; their number changes with the season.",
    "`after` the AP spending tasks, like mail, so that a run order saved before this rule cannot put the book first again; a spending task that is not selected is not waited for, one that failed blocks the book.",
    "Runs after AP spending: while AP is at 999 the game refuses every reward of the book, also one without AP ('the inventory of the item above is full', popup `inventory_full`), and nothing is received.",
    "Tabs are taken by position (second to sixth slot). A tab is opened only while it shows the red reward dot, and 'claim' is pressed only while it is yellow.",
    "After a claim the task waits until the book is uncovered again (the white top bar is bright), and only then looks on: under a window that darkens the screen the red dots do not match. A window that stays is closed with back, which is pressed only while the book is covered.",
    "A claim that went through greys the button. When it is still yellow after a second try the reward was refused, and the task fails with that message instead of reporting success."
  ],
